Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 11:58:13 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] alibabacloud: bound compressed instance user data

Encode compressed cloud-config within the ECS user-data limit and bound
decompression when the guest retrieves it. Reject malformed or oversized
input instead of accepting a truncated configuration.

Keep upstream cloud-config generation and verify that transport encoding
preserves the decoded initdata bytes and their SHA-384 digest.

